<!--
	Aeon 2 style pictures. Reference: ../AEON2_DESIGN_NOTES.md "Pictures / art".
	516: full-screen framed cards in a horizontal carousel (white frame, title in large light caps, dim sub-line);
	the neighbours peek in at both edges. Used by MyPics.xml.
